<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Payment Confirmation - MediSetu</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .logo {
      max-width: 150px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .content {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .details {
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .payment-details {
      background-color: #e8f5e9;
      border: 1px solid #c8e6c9;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .amount {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #2e7d32;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    .receipt {
      background-color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <img src="https://medisetu.com/logo.png" alt="MediSetu Logo" class="logo">
    <h1>Payment Confirmation</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <p>Dear {{userName}},</p>

    <p>Thank you for your payment. Your transaction has been successfully processed.</p>

    <div class="payment-details">
      <p><strong>Payment Status:</strong> <span style="color: #2e7d32;">Success</span></p>
      <p class="amount">₹{{amount}}</p>
      <p><strong>Payment ID:</strong> {{paymentId}}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="receipt">
      <h3>Receipt Details</h3>
      <div class="details">
        <p><strong>Doctor:</strong> Dr. {{doctorName}}</p>
        <p><strong>Appointment Date:</strong> {{appointmentDate}}</p>
        <p><strong>Appointment Time:</strong> {{appointmentTime}}</p>
        <p><strong>Payment Date:</strong> {{paymentDate}}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>Your appointment has been confirmed. You will receive a separate email with the video consultation link.</p>

    <p>Important Notes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Please keep this receipt for your records</li>
      <li>You can download the receipt from your MediSetu account</li>
      <li>For any payment-related queries, please contact our support team</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.</p>
    <p>For any queries, please contact our support team.</p>
    <p>&copy; 2024 MediSetu. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html> 